# Keep the build context small and clean. Never copy host node_modules/.next into the
# image (platform-specific binaries + the Windows pnpm hardlink issues). The image does a
# fresh `pnpm install` and `next build` from source.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
.git
.github
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
*.log
prd.txt
stockflow-prd-full.docx
docs
playwright-report
test-results
**/.playwright-mcp
